n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed empty print ignoring the `end` parameter https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/4075\r\n- Fixed `Text.from_ansi` removing newlines https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/4076\r\n- Fixed `FileProxy.isatty` not proxying https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/4077\r\n- Fixed inline code in Markdown tables cells https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/4079\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/307979473/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":6,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/307789962","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/307789962/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/307789962/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v14.3.4","id":307789962,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4SWICK","tag_name":"v14.3.4","target_commitish":"master","name":"The Faster Startup Release","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-04-11T02:55:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T02:59:31Z","published_at":"2026-04-11T02:59:31Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v14.3.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v14.3.4","body":"No new features in this release, but there should be improved startup time for Rich apps, and potentially improved runtime if you have a lot of links.\r\n\r\n## [14.3.4] - 2026-04-11\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- Improved import time with lazy loading https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/4070\r\n- Changed link id generation to avoid random number generation at runtime https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3845","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/307789962/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/288331196","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/288331196/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/288331196/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v14.3.3","id":288331196,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgu