roken regex that may have resulted in poor performance. https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3535\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/181262911/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":3,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/178391497","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/178391497/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/178391497/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.9.2","id":178391497,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4KognJ","tag_name":"v13.9.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"The Splitting segments Release","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-10-04T11:49:13Z","updated_at":"2024-10-04T11:51:48Z","published_at":"2024-10-04T11:51:48Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v13.9.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v13.9.2","body":"A hotfix for highlighting in the table, and a fix for `Segment.split_cells`\r\n\r\n## [13.9.2] - 2024-10-04\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed `Table` columns not highlighting when added by `add_row` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/3517\r\n- Fixed an issue with Segment.split_cells reported in Textual https://github.com/Textualize/textual/issues/5090\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/178391497/reactions","total_count":21,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":4,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177805913","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177805913/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177805913/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.9.1","id":177805913,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4KmRpZ","tag_name":"v13.9.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"Hotfix for dependency issue","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-10-01T13:35:48Z","updated_at":"2024-10-01T13:37:12Z","published_at":"2024-10-01T13:37:12Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v13.9.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v13.9.1","body":"## [13.9.1] - 2024-10-01\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed typing_extensions dependency\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177805913/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177786952","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177786952/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177786952/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.9.0","id":177786952,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4KmNBI","tag_name":"v13.9.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"The so long Python 3.7 release","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-10-01T12:10:58Z","updated_at":"2024-10-01T12:13:50Z","published_at":"2024-10-01T12:13:50Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v13.9.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v13.9.0","body":"This version adds support for fine-grained information in tracebacks. In other words, it will highlight columns in tracebacks (for supported Python versions). Here's an example:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1143\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-10-01 at 13 07 35\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1405f90-4ae5-4fad-83ce-05c2e4542f4e\">\r\n\r\nThis version also **drops support for Python 3.7**, which has long since reached its EOL. If you are stuck on Python3.7 for any reason, you will not be able to upgrade to this version, but nothing should break.\r\n\r\nSee below for other changes in this release.\r\n\r\n## [13.9.0] - 2024-10-01\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- Dropped support for Python3.7 https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3509\r\n- Rich will display tracebacks with finely grained error locations on python 3.11+ https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3486\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed issue with Segment._split_cells https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3506\r\n- Fix auto detection of terminal size on Windows https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/2916\r\n- `Text.style` now respected in Panel title/subtitle https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3509\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/177786952/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/174328707","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/174328707/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/174328707/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.8.1","id":174328707,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4KZAuD","tag_name":"v13.8.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"The Python 3.13 release","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-09-10T12:51:27Z","updated_at":"2024-09-10T12:54:07Z","published_at":"2024-09-10T12:54:07Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v13.8.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v13.8.1","body":"## [13.8.1] - 2024-09-10\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Added support for Python 3.13 https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3481\r\n- Fixed infinite loop when appending Text to same instance https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3480\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/174328707/reactions","total_count":43,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":3,"eyes":4}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/171980868","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/171980868/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/171980868/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.8.0","id":171980868,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODSlIsc4KQDhE","tag_name":"v13.8.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"The Thanks for your patience Release","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-08-26T16:11:40Z","updated_at":"2024-08-26T16:15:57Z","published_at":"2024-08-26T16:15:57Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/tarball/v13.8.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/zipball/v13.8.0","body":"This is a fairly large update. Mostly an accumulation of small fixes and enhancements. Nothing qualifies as a *breaking change (for some definition), but there may be some subtly changes to output. Check below for anything that might affect you!\r\n\r\n## [13.8.0] - 2024-08-26\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Fixed `Table` rendering of box elements so \"footer\" elements truly appear at bottom of table, \"mid\" elements in main table body.\r\n- Fixed styles in Panel when Text objects are used for title https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3401\r\n- Fix pretty repr for `collections.deque` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/2864\r\n- Thread used in progress.track will exit if an exception occurs in a generator https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3402\r\n- Progress track thread is now a daemon thread https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3402\r\n- Fixed cached hash preservation upon clearing meta and links https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/2942\r\n- Fixed overriding the `background_color` of `Syntax` not including padding https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/3295\r\n- Fixed pretty printing of dataclasses with a default repr in Python 3.13 https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3455\r\n- Fixed selective enabling of highlighting when disabled in the `Console` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/3419\r\n- Fixed BrokenPipeError writing an error message https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3468\r\n- Fixed superfluous space above Markdown tables https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3469\r\n- Fixed issue with record and capture interaction https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3470\r\n- Fixed control codes breaking in `append_tokens` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3471\r\n- Fixed exception pretty printing a dataclass with missing fields https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3472\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- `RichHandler` errors and warnings will now use different colors (red and yellow) https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/2825\r\n- Removed the empty line printed in jupyter while using `Progress` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/2616\r\n- Running tests in environment with `FORCE_COLOR` or `NO_COLOR` environment variables\r\n- ansi decoder will now strip problematic private escape sequences (like `\\x1b7`) https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3278/\r\n- Tree's ASCII_GUIDES and TREE_GUIDES constants promoted to class attributes\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Adds a `case_sensitive` parameter to `prompt.Prompt`. This determines if the\r\n  response is treated as case-sensitive. Defaults to `True`.\r\n- Added `Console.on_broken_pipe` https://github.com/Textualize/rich/pull/3468\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/171980868/reactions","total_count":46,"+1":26,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":15,"rocket":5,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/144016985","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/144016985/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Textualize/rich/releases/144016985/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Textualize/rich/releases/tag/v13.7.1","id":144016985,"author":{"login":"willmcgugan","id":554369,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDM2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/554369?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan","html_url":"https://github.com/willmcgugan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/willmcgugan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_a